@startuml
!include <C4/C4_Component>
skinparam componentStyle uml1
title C4 Component Diagram — Safety Watchdog
LAYOUT_LEFT_RIGHT()
AddRelTag("dashed", $lineStyle=DashedLine())
Container_Boundary(scope, "Safety Watchdog") {
  Component(C1, "Health & Freshness Monitor", "Timers · systemd state · timestamps", "Monitors service state and telemetry freshness before recovery or inhibition.")
  Component(C2, "Safety State Evaluator", "Explicit state rules", "Evaluates safe, degraded, inhibited, and recovery states.")
  Component(C3, "Proposal Inhibit Client", "Policy boundary · contract TBD", "Requests that policy stop new writes while health is unsafe or stale.")
  Component(C4, "Guarded Recovery Client", "Unix domain socket", "Requests recovery through the same authenticated actuator gates.")
  Component(C5, "Watchdog Event Publisher", "Audit store client", "Records state transitions, inhibition, and recovery outcomes.")
}
Container_Ext(S1, "Decision & Policy Service", "Supporting service", "Directly connected container outside the scope")
Container_Ext(S2, "Resource Manager / Actuator", "Supporting service", "Directly connected container outside the scope")
ContainerDb_Ext(S3, "Audit Store", "SQLite · separate local database", "Proposed persistent data store outside this scoped container")
Container_Ext(S4, "systemd service manager", "Supporting service", "Directly connected container outside the scope")
ContainerDb_Ext(S5, "Telemetry & Read-Projection Store", "SQLite · separate local database", "Proposed persistent data store outside this scoped container")
Rel(C2, C1, "IHealthSnapshot", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C3, C2, "ISafetyState", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C4, C2, "ISafetyState", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C3, S1, "IPolicyInhibit", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C4, S2, "IActionRequest", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C4, S2, "IActionOutcome", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C5, C2, "ISafetyState", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C5, S3, "IAuditStoreWrite", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C1, S4, "IServiceHealth", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
Rel(C1, S5, "IObservationFreshness", "Named local interface", $tags="dashed")
note bottom
This editable source uses C4 element and relationship macros. The synchronized SVG/PDF/PNG/JPG rendering adds the requested UML1 component tabs, square ports, required sockets, and provided lollipops. Dashed dependency arrows are the project convention.
end note
SHOW_LEGEND()
@enduml
